wb-node-red (1.0.1) stable; urgency=medium

  * Raise the wb-mqtt-homeui minimum to 2.241.0 — the release that ships the
    declarative gates.d mechanism this package consumes (2.235.4 only had the
    older snippet-based gate).
  * Trim declarative string-pin tests that duplicate file contents or the
    postinst behavior suite; executable checks, security pins and
    regression pins stay.

 -- Denis Smagin <denis.smagin@wirenboard.com>  Sun, 20 Jul 2026 18:30:00 +0200

wb-node-red (1.0.0) stable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release: native Node-RED for Wiren Board, installed with
    `apt install wb-node-red`.
    - Node-RED vendored at build time; Node.js from the distro.
    - Hardened systemd service, editor on loopback behind the homeui admin gate
      on a dedicated HTTPS port (21880); user data and runtime under /mnt/data.

 -- Denis Smagin <denis.smagin@wirenboard.com>  Wed, 01 Jul 2026 10:12:03 +0200
